> Interpretation and limits

The shared native merge producer supplies actual trace events; no report loop
reconstructs the heap. The original overlap generator used signed overflowing
LCG arithmetic. Its intended modulo2^31 recurrence now uses explicit unsigned
arithmetic; modulo sampling remains biased.

The complete editable C++ programs save figures locally; results contain
ordinary computed Markdown. Selected counters describe actual producer
operations, excluding validation when stated.

> References

The recurrence and proof above derive the implemented behavior.

