instrumented ASan/UBSan cases;45 executable public examples;127/127 definitions
across12 full scopes;10 hovers;2400 independent records/9344 checks;9 frozen
valid-input families plus the unchanged shared merge producer;11
checkout/installed standalone headers and linked ten-family consumer;40 executed
